      "writtenOn": "2020-11-17T17:28:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Side question, does this chip or similar ones support multiple ports?  That might be good to leave notes about since it looks like the current driver is written for only one port.\n\nDoes the port have to be 0 necessarily?  The task is taking a port variable.  Or is that a convention you plan to enforce in the driver that any on-chip ports are first?",
      "revId": "330236a1e8b03ed8fe67f6098b9036093c4fb4fa",
