      "writtenOn": "2020-11-17T17:28:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So this is where the driver needs to be doing some of the PRL states we currently count on TCPCs to do.  Here, we\u0027ll need to implement PRL_Tx_Match_MessageID State to verify the GoodCRC is for the right msgid.  \n\nRelated question, does the hardware implement retires for you when the partner doesn\u0027t GoodCRC, or does the driver need to do this as well?  We\u0027re currently counting on the TCPCs to retry for us, since retrying from the EC PRL is too slow to match compliance requirements on chromebooks at least.",
      "revId": "330236a1e8b03ed8fe67f6098b9036093c4fb4fa",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
