      "author": {
        "id": 1123814
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-11-24T16:49:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have added a check now to ensure that a GoodCRC isn\u0027t validated without matching the expected msgID. \n\nIn addition, the ucpd task now has a state machine implementation to support the auto-retry requirement. UCPD isn\u0027t a TCPC so the driver does need to do some things which we assume are handled in the TCPC.",
      "parentUuid": "76da7f35_7ef86eeb",
